      "Language": "tur",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Primary tumors of trachea are rare tumors those can be missed easily because the symptoms and signs are subtle. The diagnosis may delay or they may be misdiagnosed as chronic bronchitis or asthma. We present a 64 year-old man with dyspnea, cough, cyanosis and with a normal chest radiogram."},
